From: akimfomin <akim.fomin@mail.ru>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 02:09:54 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Recompiler: preserve adjacent wave32 pixel carry masks

The mask liveness table describes a wave64 register pair. A carry in a wave32 pixel shader writes one dword, preserving the next SGPR. Keep the neighboring word live so a later popcount sees the full mask at partially covered triangle edges. Keep existing wave64 analysis and ballot admission. Add register and raster regressions.
---
